        <p>Appointments by Public Bodies. - - COUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON. EDUCATION COMMITTEE. HEAD MISTRESS, INFANTS' SCHOOL. Applications are invited for the post of HEAD MISTRESS of the Infants' Department of the St. Ann's C.E. School. Commencing salary £ll5 per annum, rising according to scale. Candidates must possess either the Elemen- tary or the Higher Certificate of the Froebel Union, in respect of which extra payments are made. Applications Must be made on the official form, which, together ,with a copy of the scale of salaries, may be obtained on application (with a stamped addressed envelope) to the undersigned, to whom they must be returned by not later than Monday, the 21st September. J. MOORE MURRAY, M.Sc., Secretary and Director. Education Office, Sankey-street, Warrington, 4th, September, 1914.</p>
